# ActiveCivilPolicyProbe'un gerçek0..8 haftaları;39/59 veya kategori state'i enjekte edilmez.
# İlk emir sırası root'un istediği budget/accord/bread/subsidy; probe'dan yalnız journal sırası farklıdır.
# Root'un konumlandırdığı Economy alt bölümü için mevcut5000 bottom-scroll kullanılır; oyun clamp eder.
new
lang ru
select normandy
panel economy
scroll document 5000
expect UrbanApproval 35
expect Week 0
expect Gold 840
expect Food 360
expect Troops 1200
expect SelectedUnrest 30
remember mood-baseline
wait 0.7
state 00-baseline-35
shot 00-baseline-35-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-baseline
shot 01-baseline-35-tr

establishment budget 1000
select champagne
accord grant
act bread
select ile
act subsidy
select normandy
panel economy
expect UrbanApproval 37
expect Gold 840
expect Food 320
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect SubsidyParis True
expect HasAccord True
expect AccordUntilWeek 4
expect ArmyPolicyId budget
expect ArmyTargetTroops 1000
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 2
expect TaxIncome 197
expect ArmyCost 136
expect ArmyConsumption 40
expect ForageFood 0
expect SelectedUnrest 30
remember mood-before-40
lang ru
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
state 02-before-37-to-40
shot 02-before-37-to-40-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-before-40
shot 03-before-37-to-40-tr

# Destek gerçekten ödenir:37→40. Bölgesel etki hesap sonrasındaki40'a göre uygulanır.
week
expect Week 1
expect UrbanApproval 40
expect Gold 901
expect Food 304
expect MilitarySupplies 128
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect Power 55.5
expect SelectedUnrest 30
panel economy
remember mood-after-40
lang ru
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
state 04-after-40
shot 04-after-40-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-after-40
shot 05-after-40-tr

# İkinci hafta gerçek eski1200 bütçesini öder, sonra200 kişiyi rezerve aktarır ve petition getirir.
week
expect Week 2
expect UrbanApproval 43
expect Gold 964
expect Food 288
expect MilitarySupplies 136
expect Troops 1000
expect Manpower 2600
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect PendingPetition True
expect SelectedUnrest 30
remember mood-petition-blocked
week
same mood-petition-blocked
expect Week 2
expect UrbanApproval 43
# Gerçek petition modal'i Economy'yi örtebilir; root kareyi inceler, state yazılarak gizlenmez.
panel economy
lang ru
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
state 06-petition-blocked
shot 06-petition-blocked-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-petition-blocked
shot 07-petition-blocked-tr
save
load
same mood-petition-blocked
state 07-petition-loaded
petition negotiate
expect PendingPetition False
expect PetitionResolved True
expect UrbanApproval 43

# Probe bu haftalarda yeni sivil emir istemez; subsidy ve ilk anlaşma kendi takviminde sürer.
week
expect Week 3
expect UrbanApproval 46
expect Gold 1060
expect Food 279
expect Troops 1000
week
expect Week 4
expect UrbanApproval 49
expect Gold 1159
expect Food 270
expect HasAccord False
week
expect Week 5
expect UrbanApproval 52
expect Gold 1281
expect Food 262
week
expect Week 6
expect UrbanApproval 55
expect Gold 1406
expect Food 254
week
expect Week 7
expect UrbanApproval 58
expect Gold 1532
expect Food 246
expect MilitarySupplies 181
expect Troops 1000
expect Manpower 2600
expect Power 58.5
expect SubsidyParis True
expect SelectedRegionId normandy
expect SelectedUnrest 30
expect TaxIncome 247
expect ArmyCost 120
expect ArmyConsumption 34
expect ForageFood 0
panel economy
remember mood-before-61
lang ru
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
state 08-before-58-to-61
shot 08-before-58-to-61-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-before-61
shot 09-before-58-to-61-tr

#58→61 gerçek haftası: Normandy30→29, kaynaklar gerçek127 altın/−8 gıda hesabıyla değişir.
week
expect Week 8
expect UrbanApproval 61
expect Gold 1659
expect Food 238
expect MilitarySupplies 190
expect Troops 1000
expect Manpower 2600
expect Power 59
expect SelectedUnrest 29
expect SubsidyParis True
expect ArmyPolicyId budget
expect ArmyTargetTroops 1000
expect ArmyReductionDueWeek 0
expect PendingPetition False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
expect BattleActive False
panel economy
remember mood-after-61
lang ru
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
state 10-after-61
shot 10-after-61-ru
lang tr
scroll document 5000
wait 0.7
same mood-after-61
shot 11-after-61-tr
save
select champagne
load
same mood-after-61
expect UrbanApproval 61
expect SelectedRegionId normandy
state 11-final-loaded
quit
